WEBVTT

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:30.245
"Iridium layer at the K-T boundary,

00:10:30.269 --> 00:10:32.690
and potassium argon dated
crater in Yucatan,

00:10:32.714 --> 00:10:35.325
indicate that an asteroid
killed the dinosaurs."

00:10:35.349 --> 00:10:37.976
Perfectly ordinary scientific paper.

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:39.533
Now, the next one.

00:10:39.557 --> 00:10:42.222
"The President of the Royal Society

00:10:42.246 --> 00:10:46.734
has been vouchsafed
a strong inner conviction

00:10:46.758 --> 00:10:49.261
that an asteroid killed the dinosaurs."

00:10:49.285 --> 00:10:51.238
(Laughter)

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:59.332
"It has been privately
revealed to Professor Huxtane

00:10:59.356 --> 00:11:01.277
that an asteroid killed the dinosaurs."